{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226928","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226928","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422692801:1":{"text":"평민이 감히 반항하는 거냐? 은혜의 이슬의 우선권은 귀족에게 있다는 걸 몰라?","source_cn":"平民，你怎敢反抗？难道不知道恩典灵露应当优先供应给贵族吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFEE5F3C525F0E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422692802:1":{"text":"무, 무슨 소리예요! 저희 아이도 죄악화를 막기 위해 은혜의 이슬이 필요하다고요!","source_cn":"凭、凭什么！我的孩子同样需要灵露抵抗孽化！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05776FBAC398A3AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422692803:1":{"text":"게다가, 이제 다들 평등하잖아요! 그 귀족이라는 신분은 아무런 쓸모도 없다고요!","source_cn":"何、何况，现在大家都一样！你的贵族身份，不值钱了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51E718D18E2EC722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422692804:1":{"text":"멍청하긴! 고귀한 혈통만이 은혜의 이슬을 올바르게 쓸 수 있어!","source_cn":"愚蠢！只有高贵血脉才能正确使用灵露的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A9490F435C56ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422692805:1":{"text":"말도 안 되는 소리! 은혜의 이슬은 저주를 억제하기 위한 것입니다. 모든 에세일이 공평하게 받을 수 있으며, 우선권 따위는 존재하지 않습니다!","source_cn":"荒谬！灵露是为了抵御诅咒的影响，所有艾塞勒人都有资格获取。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7287E530B9347059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422692806:1":{"text":"인듀어 님, 여기는 어쩐 일이십니까...?","source_cn":"因、因度厄大人？您怎么会在这里……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF520D1B344DF2828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422692807:1":{"text":"비정상적으로 유통되는 은혜의 이슬에 대해 알아보러 나왔습니다. 그런데, 뭔가 아시는 것이 있는 모양이군요.","source_cn":"我正在调查灵露异常流通的情况。看来你对此很有见解？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A344497E1C17F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422692808:1":{"text":"저, 저는 그저 평민에게 예절을 가르치고 있을 뿐이었습니다...","source_cn":"我……我只是在教导这些平民应有的礼节……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D737D80B1AFDCFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422692809:1":{"text":"인듀어 님! 저 자가 “전통”이라면서 제가 산 은혜의 이슬을 빼앗으려고 했습니다!","source_cn":"大人！他要抢走我买到的灵露！说这是“传统”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDBE16BEEB96E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422692810:1":{"text":"...그런 적 없습니다! 먼저 실례하지요!","source_cn":"……我、我没事了，我先告辞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x895AB481ED412678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1422692811:0":{"text":"은혜의 이슬을 가로채려고 했던 귀족은 재빨리 자리를 떴고, 남겨진 불안해 보이는 평민도 이 자리를 피하고 싶어 했다.","source_cn":"抢夺灵露的贵族飞快地溜走了，只剩不安的平民，似乎要想要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D9D04A24286761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422692812:1":{"text":"감사합니다, 인듀어 님. 그럼 저도...","source_cn":"谢谢因度厄大人！我也先——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59F50A525CCCA981","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422692813:1":{"text":"잠깐, 은혜의 이슬을 샀다고요? 정상적인 배급품이 아닌 것 같은데요.","source_cn":"别走，买来的灵露是怎么回事？现在不是正常配给吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197D7DE3BDE3CE4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422692814:1":{"text":"인듀어 님... 은혜의 이슬이 곧 떨, 떨어진다는 소식을 들어서요! 암시장에서 샀습니다...","source_cn":"大人……我听说灵露快、快没了！只能从暗市买了点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00A6A0AC22E7A35E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422692815:1":{"text":"앞으로는 귀족들에게만 지급된다고 해서... 저는...","source_cn":"他们说……之后只有贵族才能获得供应……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0329D4149992A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422692816:0":{"text":"누가 그런 헛소문을 퍼뜨렸지요?","source_cn":"谁在散布这种谣言？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x127935B4EB664BF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422692817:1":{"text":"마, 말할 수 없습니다...","source_cn":"我、我不敢说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3DDB8B237B9BD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422692818:1":{"text":"두려워하지 마십시오. 저희는 그 문제를 해결하러 왔습니다.","source_cn":"不必害怕，我们就是来解决此事的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCB7036E5B7F7C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422692819:0":{"text":"그... 네... 은월의 제단의 제사장들이었어요... 다들 저주가 가짜라고 했어요!","source_cn":"好吧……是银月祭庭的祭司们……她们说诅咒是假的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC80A4B1F8EDC5E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1422692819":{"text":"그... 네... 은월의 제단의 제사장들이었어요... 다들 저주가 가짜라고 했어요!","source_cn":"好吧……是银月祭庭的祭司们……她们说诅咒是假的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC80A4B1F8EDC5E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1422692820:1":{"text":"저, 저도 그냥 들은 겁니다. 제사장들이 저주와 드래곤에 관한 건 전부 거짓말이라고 했어요.","source_cn":"我、我就是复述。她们说那些关于诅咒和龙的故事都是谎言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5727CD6E8F562A17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1422692821:1":{"text":"인자하신 여왕님이 돌아가신 이후로 은혜의 이슬의 원천이 말라서 모든 에세일들에게 돌아갈 수 없대요.","source_cn":"仁慈的女王陛下死后，灵露源头就在逐渐枯竭，根本不够所有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30348DEE463B270B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1422692822:1":{"text":"그리고 사리에 님이 그 사실을 숨기려고 지상에 새로운 세계가 저희를 기다리고 있다는 거짓말을 했다고도 했어요.","source_cn":"她们还说，沙利叶大人为了掩盖真相，才声称地表上有新世界...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD13FCDFD3B17D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1422692823:1":{"text":"그 말을 믿고 지상으로 간 사람들은 다들 죄악화됐다면서, 사, 사리에 님이 저희 모두를 지상으로 보내 죽이려고 한대요!","source_cn":"而听信传言去地表的人，都孽化了。沙、沙利叶大人其实是在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA088DB2ABBBF7E14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1422692824:1":{"text":"허점이 있지만, 외부인이 듣기에는 꽤 그럴듯해 보입니다.","source_cn":"有漏洞，但在我一个外人听来，这确实很像真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25FEFEA11ED68BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1422692825:1":{"text":"그래서... 다들 의심하기 시작했어요! 저, 저도...","source_cn":"所以……很多人开始怀疑了！我、我也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87444A14375633FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1422692826:1":{"text":"잘 들으십시오. 저는 방금 지상에서 돌아왔고, 저주는 실제로 존재합니다. 하지만 저주를 풀 방법을 찾았어요.","source_cn":"听着，我刚从地表回来。诅咒确实存在，但我们也找到了解除...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9CA89070943449B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1422692827:1":{"text":"곧 모든 에세일들이 은혜의 이슬 없이도 살 수 있을 겁니다!","source_cn":"很快，所有艾塞勒人都不必再依赖灵露！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8C75C5E8583C390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1422692828:1":{"text":"정말인가요? 하지만 드레이아 님이...","source_cn":"真的吗？可德莱雅大人说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8FB7CB58596D1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:36:1422692828":{"text":"정말인가요? 하지만 드레이아 님이...","source_cn":"真的吗？可德莱雅大人说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8FB7CB58596D1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1422692829:1":{"text":"저, 저에게 은혜의 이슬을 파신 분이에요...","source_cn":"就是、我就是从她那里买到了灵露……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA0C69E3245E048F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1422692830:0":{"text":"은혜의 이슬을 어디서 샀습니까?","source_cn":"她在哪里交易灵露？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25737E5ECEEE58E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1422692831:1":{"text":"은월의 제단에서요... 사흘마다 해 질 녘에 비밀 모임을 가진대요.","source_cn":"银月祭庭……每三天的黄昏会有一次秘密集会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43736027B7B8D61E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1422692832:1":{"text":"알겠습니다. 알려줘서 고맙습니다.","source_cn":"我知道了，多谢你的信息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x090C073635E333FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1422692833:1":{"text":"인듀어 님... 대체 뭐가 진실인가요? 저는 단지 죄악화가 되고 싶지 않을 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"大人——到底什么是真的？我只是不想孽化……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BEC6A66BCF7EC8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1422692834:1":{"text":"조금만 기다리면 진실이 곧 밝혀질 겁니다.","source_cn":"等着看吧，真相会大白的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B3FBC81EE6538F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:36:0:1":{"text":"그건 누구야?","source_cn":"她是谁？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x530E12107F32AA44","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그건 누구야?","female":"그건 누구야?","variant_male_record_index":"73506","variant_female_record_index":"73507","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:0:1":{"text":"저주는 진짜야","source_cn":"诅咒是真的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8F483592A8FAFE1F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저주는 진짜야","female":"저주는 진짜야","variant_male_record_index":"73504","variant_female_record_index":"73505","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贪婪的贵族":{"text":"탐욕스러운 귀족","source":"贪婪的贵族","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:愤怒的平民":{"text":"분노한 평민","source":"愤怒的平民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":39,"localized_text_count":38,"speaker_count":5}}